#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/grdhisteq.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.grdhisteq.grdhisteq.equalize_grid:3
msgid ""
":meth:`pygmt.grdhisteq.equalize_grid` provides a way to write a grid with "
"statistics based on a cumulative distribution function. The ``outgrid`` has "
"relative highs and lows in the same (x,y) locations as the ``grid``, but the "
"values are changed to reflect their place in the cumulative distribution."
msgstr ""

